<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">Itsaangi (TSA) NT en Kitsaangi</book>
  <para style="h">1 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Te</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a tsomi wa Pahuli huli bisu Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a tsomi wa Pahuli huli bisu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Pahuli atsonzihi baatu mu uvaanga libundu la Tesalonika, mu mudyenge a nde wa myole wu isalu, bu nde hamati hu musyenge a Filipo. Musyenge a Tesalonika, musyenge wu li hu Noode-Esete a tsi Bangeleke, mu itaanzi hya Masedonya. Musyenge wu ayabaana mu mumbungu. Byenyi bi bilahi bili mu utsahala hu Tesalonika. Kabu lilinene li Bayudaayo laayatsahala huuna. Ba banzuhisini ŋa hati la bo, a baasilisi ndongisili a Pahuli ve. Buuna, bo baabingi nde. Pahuli li mu usonehe muhanda mo wunuwu, huli bisu Tesalonika ba baasiingi ndongisili a nde yi imiinu hi inyatihi. Nde li mu uhwada mu ndongisili a nde huli bisu Tesalonika. Bangeele babaayiha Bibila, bali mu utsima ti wunuwu ni muhanda wa hati a tsomi wu Pahuli hasonehe huli Bamukristo. Tso huli buuna, muhanda mo wunuwu, li watsomi wu baasonehe mu nzuhisini li linyatihi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mabuli <char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1-3">1–3</ref> </char> mali mu uyabisa bisu itwadi hya Pahuli na bisu Tesalonika. Pahuli miiyaka tsangu yimbwe mu libundu la bo. Nde miiyibwala bo moonyi mu isalu hi nde hasiidi ŋa hati la bo. Nde li mu umweese lehemene la nde mu umonono na bo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu mabuli ma <char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4-5">4–5</ref></char>, Pahuli li mu uhwadisa bisu Tesalonika mu ukula mu imiinu. Nde li mu uva mvutu mu byuhu bi bili mu ukwamisa libundu, li likini a laayeli ve. Bamukristo ba hati a tsomi, baakakeele ti Yisu ulenge aya. Dyambu ni linili: baa libundu bakima bali mu ukwa, ka Yisu a hali mu ulengeyafutaha ve. Buuna Bamukristo bali mu ufuula: «Buni huuba mu ba bamiikwa?» Pahuli li mu ubindula bo ti <char style="em">babaakwa na bamoonyi, bali boosi itwadi na Yisu Kristo</char>. Ilumbu hyuya, hi boosi buusuuha mu lipfu. Ni mu buuna, hu li na tsongo mu ukeele nziili a Pfumu Yisu, ka muutu tso mumosi a hayaba ilumbu hi nde huuya ve. Hi hyafulala talu, ni mu uba likoongo na Pfumu, we bu nde ali mu uvondo lo.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Ni me Pahuli, itwadi na Silaasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Silaasi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nduhi kima yi bali mu uteele «Silivani».</char></note> na Timoteho, ndi mu utsindaha muhanda mo wunuwu huli libundu la bisu Tesalonika, li lili mu Nzambi Taata na mu Pfumu Yisu Kristo. Nyaha bava benu hyese na hyenze.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imiinu na ifwaani hi libundu la Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Bisu libaafutala matondo taangu yoosi huli Nzambi mu tooni a benu boosi, na libaatangula benu mu masambulu ma bisu. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Bisu lili mu uyibwala moonyi pasi taangu ŋa busu bwa Nzambi Taata a bisu, mu tooni isalu hi imiinu hya benu, isalu hi litondo la benu, na kwadili a benu mu hiitu mu Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Baana baa ngu baa Nzambi hatondo, bisu layaaba ti benu lili ba baamisoolo, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />mu tooni ati ndongisili a bisu yi Musamu wu Mubwe huli benu ndulu a mu mikuma ve. Ka ndongisili a bisu yaaba yi matwala, mu itwadi hi Livupu la Ngidi, na hiitu hyoosi. Benu layaaba buni mbiili a bisu yaaba ŋa hati la benu, mu libwe la benu. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Benu laduukala ifwaani hya bisu na hya Pfumu. Mu taangu mo yiina, benu laamono mapasi ma manono, ka benu laayaka Mambu ma Nzambi na kinya yi Livupu la Ngidi. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Na benu kaka lika ifwaani mu boosi ba bali mu usa imiinu hu itaanzi hya Masedonya na hu tsi a Ahayi. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Eye, isalu hya Mambu ma Pfumu ŋa hati la benu, hyaduma hu Masedonya na Ahayi. Ka hyo a hyasuka ŋaana ve. Tsangu imiinu hya benu mu Nzambi yamiitsamuha tsi yoosi. Ni mu buuna luuveletsuha mu lo. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Boosi bali mu utoyo mu nzakili yi benu laayaki bisu. Bo bali mu utoyo kaka, bu benu laakinguhi huli Nzambi. Benu laatiimbi bifwita mu usalila Nzambi wu li moonyi na wu li mbuli, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />na mu ukeele bu Mwana a nde humata hu mayulu. Ni nde Nzambi hasuuli ŋa hati la babaakwa, Yisu wu uyobolo bisu ŋa busu bwa tsyembili a Nzambi yi yili mu uya.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli hu Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Benu mwakulu layaaba, baana ba ngu, ti nziili a bisu huli benu a yili yi yavele na kaluha ve. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Ka benu liyabi kaka ti bisu laayaka bituhi na laamono pasi hu musyenge a Filipo. Ka Nzambi ahwadisa mana bisu lilongese Musamu a nde wu Mubwe, hutso a mbingisili.<verse eid="1TH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Mambu ma bisu laakalongese a maaba ma mapfuta, buuve ma soho ve, na bisu a laakasaha usoho tso muutu mumosi ve. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Naana! Nzambi asusa bisu ŋa busu bwa lobese na nde ava bisu Musamu a nde wu Mubwe. Bisu a lili mu utoyo mu usaha muyusu a baatu ve, ka muyusu a Nzambi wu ayaaba matsimi ma mitima mya bisu. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Benu layaaba lo bubwe, bisu a libaasalila lipedi tso hoole ve. Bisu kaka a lili mu uswehe manzala ma mapfuta humbisa a ma bisu lili mu uleele ve. Nzambi nde mwakulu li mbangi a bisu. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Bisu a laasaha ti muutu asilasa bisu ve, tso benu, tso bakima. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Bisu beedi na muswa mu unangimana benu, bu bisu lili biluumbi bya Kristo. Ka bisu laamweese bulembo bwa bisu ŋa hati la benu, we ngu wu li mu ukeelese bibabana bi nde ubaabuungala. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Bisu laatondo benu mu itesi hi ulongese benu Musamu wu Mubwe wa Nzambi. Litondo mo liina laamiivangimasa bisu mu uva kaka muvumu a bisu mwakulu. Benu laaba na talu yi yafulala ŋa busu bwa bisu! <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Baana baa ngu, benu lili mu uyibwala moonyi mu mapasi ma bisu na ikolili hya bisu. Ni mbuli bisu laakalongese benu Musamu wu Mubwe wa Nzambi hwavele ukolo. Bisu laakasala nyangu na butsuhu, mu ubweveleva mupfuna huli pasi nde ŋa hati la benu.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Benu lili bambangi ba bisu, napa Nzambi kaka. Mbiili a bisu ŋa busu bwa benu baa nga imiinu, yaaba yi yatsyeme, ya tsiitsa, yi yavele masyembo. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Benu liyaabi ti, bisu laaba mu pasi muutu mu benu, we bu taata ali mu baana ba nde. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Bisu laahwadisi benu, laabombisili benu na laayelisi benu mu ubaaba na mbiili yi yafwana ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. Nde wu li mu uteele benu mu ukoto mu ipfumu hya nde na mu muyusu a nde.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Ni mu buuna, bisu libaafutala matondo huli Nzambi taangu yoosi, bu benu laayaki mambu ma bisu laayabisi benu. Benu a laayaki mo we mambu ma maapali mu muutu ve, ka we bu mo mali ma mbuli, Mambu ma Nzambi, ma mali mu usala na mifudi, ma benu lili mu usa hiitu mu mo. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Baana baa ngu, benu laamweese buuna, bu benu laaduukala ifwaani hi mabundu ma Nzambi ma itaanzi hya Yude, ma mu baasa imiinu mu Yisu Kristo. Mu tooni ati, baatu ba tsi a benu baamweesi benu pasi, we bu mabundu maamoni pasi ŋa busu bu lituma li Bayudaayo. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Bo ni ba baadubi Pfumu Yisu Kristo na mimbihuli. Bo baanyongisi bisu kaka. Bo bali bababi ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. Bo bali baboho ba baatu boosi. <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Bo bali mu ukala bisu mu ulongese huli ba bavele Bayudaayo, Mambu ma Nzambi ma mu ubehele bo liyobolo. Bo bali mu ukulasa itesi hi masumu ma bo baasiidi. Ka kesi a Nzambi yamiibwila bo.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli na nzala ubwemono bisu Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Mu mamatali bisu, baana ba ngu, bisu laaba we bitsana bi bamiitahusa kidumana na benu, mu mwaana a taangu mu miisu, ka a mu mutima ve. Bisu lasaha uyafutaha huli benu, mono buni bisu laasiidi mifudi myosi, mu ubwemono biinzi bya benu. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Ni mu buuna, bisu laatondi uyamono benu. Na me Pahuli, me anzyehili yehele limosi buuve nzyehele yoole. Ka Saatana akali bisu. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Ni benu, a baatu bakima ve, lili hiitu hya bisu, kinya a bisu na iliimbu hya mbiingili a bisu, yi bisu luutwala usa nyeme ŋa busu bwa Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo, ŋa nde huuya. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Eye, benu lili tooni muyusu a bisu na kinya a bisu!<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Ni mu buuna, bu bisu laaveletwala ukuunda ubwekeele bunzuhisini, bisu laamono bubwe mu uyaba siha hu musyenge a Atenesi. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Bisu latsindaha benu mwaana a ngu a bisu Timoteho, wu li tsyengi a me mu isalu hya Nzambi, mu nzabisili a Musamu wu Mubwe wa Kristo. Bisu laatuma nde mu uhwadisa benu na uva benu mandoongi mu tooni imiinu hya benu, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />mana pasi muutu avelebwa hutso ikolili mu tooni a mbingisili yi lili mu ubwana. Benu mwakulu liyabi lo, yiina ni kesili a Nzambi mu bisu. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Ŋa bisu laaba kini ŋa hati la benu, bisu laakayibusa benu ti buumweese bisu pasi. Maana ni ma mavangimi, benu liyabi lo bubwe. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ni mu buuna, bu me akambwepeletwala ukuunda ukeele, me atsindihi benu Timoteho mu usaha uyaaba kwadili imiinu hya benu. Me akambata boomo ti mukuyi, mulobisi mo wunuwu, alobese benu na pasi a bisu a yiba ya mu pu.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ka bunuubu, Timoteho miiyafutahala bisu, na nde ava bisu matsangu ma mabwe mu tooni imiinu hya benu na litondo la benu. Nde ayabisa bisu, ti benu a laakolo mu utsima bisu na litondo loosi ve. Na ti benu lili na nzala mu ubwemono bisu, we bu bisu kaka lili na nzala ubwemono benu. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Ni mu buuna baana ba ngu, hutso minyongi mya bisu na mapasi ma bisu moosi, bisu laahwadi mu matsangu mo maana, mu tooni imiinu hya benu. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Bunuubu, idiingu hya bisu hika lisuunga, mu tooni ati benu limiikangama mu Pfumu mu idiingu hya benu. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Buni bisu luusinzafutala matondo huli Nzambi mu benu, mu kinya yoosi yi benu lili mu uva bisu, ŋa busu bwe nde? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Butsuhu na nyangu, bisu libaavondo nde na mukonono woosi, mu uva bisu nzila mu ubwemono benu na mu usuungaha bi byaveleyelemene mu imiinu hya benu.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Nyaha Nzambi Taata a bisu nde mwakulu na Pfumu a bisu Yisu, badibula bisu nzila yi uto natee huli benu. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Nyaha Pfumu asinzakulasa na asinzaluusa litondo li benu lili na lo mu bana na mu baatu boosi, mu ifwaani hi litondo li bisu lili na lo mu benu. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Nyaha nde ahwadisa mitima mya benu, mana benu liba bangidi, ba baavele masyembo ŋa busu bwa Nzambi taata bisu, ŋa Pfumu a bisu Yisu huuya na bapofi ba nde boosi. Amen!<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Hu tsyelele, benu laayihi huli bisu mbiili yi benu lafwana uba na yo mu ubaamweese Nzambi kinya. Eye, benu laaka na mbiili mo yiina. Ka bunuubu, bisu livondi na litumi benu mu ubaafulala usa buuna mu nduhi a Pfumu Yisu. Vaangaani bu hwafulala maana! <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Mu tooni ati, benu lamiiyaaba matumili ma bisu laava benu, matumili ma maamata huli Pfumu Yisu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Litondo la Nzambi ni ti, benu liba na idiingu hya ngidi na utahuha na ndyatili yi bumbembo. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Pasi muutu ŋa hati la benu ayaaba ubaatuma nyutu a nde, we bu hwafwana mu ubaadyata mu bungidi na butsitu. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />A lisiinga ubwa mu mapeyu ma mavele lisuunga ve, we bu hubaasa bangoyi, ba baveleyaba Nzambi. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Mu musamu mo wunuwu, pasi muutu avelemweese mwaana a ngu a nde pasi, tso uyibala nde. Pfumu yaabi usyembe pasi bubi bwa pila yiina. Bisu laamiileele benu lo, na laamiiyibusa benu mu tooni a lo. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Nzambi a hateele bisu mu ukangama mu ndyatili yi yasumaha ve, ka mu uba na mbiili yi bungidi. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Ni mu buuna, pasi nde wu uveleyaka ndongisili mo yiniiyi, a muutu nde anyasuli ve, ka nde li mu unyasula Nzambi, wu ubaava benu Livupu la nde la Ngidi.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Mu ma mali mu utala dyaambu li litondo li bumwana bu bungu, benu a lili na nzala ti basonehele benu ve. Mu tooni ati Nzambi nde mwakulu amiilongese benu, buni benu laafwana ubaatondosono. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Buuna ni bu benu lili mu uvanga huli baana ba ngu boosi ba hu tsi a Masedonya yoosi. Ka bisu livondi benu, baana bangu, mu ubwevaanga bu hwafulala bubwe. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Hwadaani mu ubaaba mu hyenze. Nyaha pasi muutu abaaduukala ndulu misamu mi mili mu utala nde. Hwafwana huli pasi muutu mu ubaha kaluha mu isalu hya myoho mya nde mwakulu, we bu bisu laatswamini utuma benu. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Buuna, ba baavele baa Kristo buuyusa mbiili a benu, na benu a libaakwamisa bana mu pasi dyaambu li limiitala benu.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nziili a Pfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Baana baa ngu, bisu litondi ti benu liyaaba imbuli mu tooni a babaakwa. Bisu a litondi ve ti benu liba na lingebe, we baatu ba baavele na hiitu. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Tso bisu lili na hiitu ti Yisu akwidi na nde asuuhi ŋa hati la babaakwa, bisu lili mu usa kaka hiitu ti mu Yisu, Nzambi sa asuula boosi babaakwa. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Bunuubu, yuhaani ma bisu liyabisi benu, we bu huli mu uleele ndongisili mosi ya Pfumu: bisu baa luusaala moonyi ŋa Pfumu huuya, a luutswamina babaakwa mu mbwanini a Yisu ve. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Baatu buuyuha ndaha a mukuutu bapofi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mukuutu bapofi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mutumi bapofi ba Nzambi; utwala uba Mikayeli: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:9">Yud 9</ref></char>.</note>, na puunga a kulambeete a Nzambi. Hiina ni iliimbu hya ti, Pfumu nde mwakulu sa ayakulamana. Ba baakwidi mu Kristo sa batswamina usuuha. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Na titswene, bisu baa luusaala moonyi mu taangu mo yiina, sa bavolo bisu itwadi na bo mu mayidu, mu ubwana na Pfumu hu yulu. Na bisu sa liba na Pfumu nzyeni. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Ni mu buuna, hwadasanaani mu mambu mo maniima.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ilumbu hya Pfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Baana baa ngu, mu ma mali mu utala matangu na bilumbu, benu a lili na nzala ati basonehele benu ve. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Mu tooni ati benu liyabi bubwe-bubwe benu mwakulu, ti ilumbu hya Pfumu sa iya we muyibi hutso butsuhu. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Tangu yi baatu buuba mu uleele bunuubu: «Tsi yoosi yika hutso a hyenze, midiingu a misaali ve», ŋaana ni ŋa mapasi muupuhama ŋa yulu a bo we ŋa misoongo mibaabaanda mukaasu nga yimi. Muutu tso mumosi a huufuuha ve.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Baana baa ngu, benu a lili hutso a piipidi ve, mana ilumbu hya Pfumu iyiila benu we muyibi. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Mu tooni ati, benu boosi lili baana ba liyalala, ba bali mu udyata mu liyalala. Bisu a benu a lili baatu ba butsuhu tso baa piipidi ve. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Bisu a benu a libwamina we baatu bakima ve, ka bisu a benu laafwana uba likanda, na ukuta linyutu. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Babwamini, ni butsuhu bali mu ubwamina. Bakoli baa malamu kaka, ni butsuhu bali mu ukolo malamu. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Ka bisu baa lili baana ba liyalala, bisu laafwana ukuta linyutu. Likaangaani imiinu na litondo we ikutu hi itali na hiitu hi liyobolo we ibudu hi midiingu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Esa 59.17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:11-17">Efe 6.11-17</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Nzambi a hateele bisu mu ubwana tsyembili a nde ve, ka mu ubaha liyobolo mu Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Yisu Kristo akwa mu tooni a bisu, mana tso lili moonyi buuve babaakwa, bisu liba moonyi itwadi na nde. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Ni mu buuna, hwadasanaani na kumbasanaani mu ukula mu imiinu, we bu benu lili mu ubaasa.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandoongi ma tsyelele na mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Baana baa ngu, bisu livondi benu mu ubaakiinza ba bali mu usala na bugeele bwosi ŋa hati la benu. Baakiinzaani ba bali mu usuungaha benu mu nduhi a Pfumu, na ba bali mu uyelese benu. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Baamweesaani bo litondo na likiinzu lilinene mu tooni a kwadili a bo mu isalu. Baabaani mu hyenze ŋa hati la benu.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Baana baa ngu, bisu livondi benu mu ubaayibusa baa bubaasala hyayuhu. Baahwadisaani baa mitima myamiiduka, baakumbasaani ba baavele mifudi, baabaani na bulembo ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Kebaani muutu a hafutala ma mabi mu ma mabi ve, ka mu pasi taangu, baasahaani libwe ŋa hati la benu, na ŋa hati la baatu boosi.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Kwilalaani mu kinya, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />baasambilaani taangu yoosi. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Baafutalaani matondo huli Nzambi mu pasi musamu. Liina ni li Nzambi ubaavondo benu, mu idiingu hya benu na Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />A lidimasa Livupu la Ngidi ve. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />A lirokolo mbihulili ve. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Ka baakengesaani pasi dyaambu, baakangaani ma mali ma mabwe. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Tahuhaani na pasi dyaambu li libi.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Nyaha Nzambi wu li suhu la hyenze, akuhasa bungidi bwa nde boosi mu benu. Na nde akeelese benu we bu hwafwana: iluunzi hyoosi, muvumu woosi na nyutu yoosi bya benu, biveleba na masyembo mu ilumbu hya nziili a Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Wu li mu uteele benu li wu akuha, nde sa atswihasa maana moosi.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Baana baa ngu, baasambilaani kaka mu tooni a bisu. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Bumbasanaani na litondo, we baana ba ngu. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Me ndi mu utuma benu mu nduhi a Pfumu: taangaani muhanda mo wunuwu huli baana ba ngu boosi.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Nyaha hyese hya Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo hiba na benu boosi!<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>